oned above, we get the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(0,0) & =2{e}^{(0)(0)-(0)} \\\\  & =2 \\\\ f(2,0) & =2{e}^{(2)(0)-(2)} \\\\  & =2{e}^{-2} \\\\ f(0,1) & =2{e}^{(0)(1)-(0)} \\\\  & =2 \\\\ f(0,2) & =2{e}^{(0)(2)-(0)} \\\\  & =2 \\\\ f(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{2}) & =2{e}^{(1/2)(3/2)-(1/2)} \\\\  & =2\\sqrt[4]{e}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nTherefore, on the closed region $D,$ we have that \n\n- $f$ attains the global minimum of $2{e}^{-2}$ at the point $(2,0),$ and\n\n- $f$ attains the global maximum of $2\\sqrt[4]{e}$ at the point $(\\frac{1}{2},\\frac{3}{2}).$" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382053 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382054 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382055 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382056 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382057 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1041 "selection" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382053 13194139536067 true] [17592186382052 1110 #uuid "d51b8917-ea4a-5652-8f39-945a3ee370d9" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382053 1034 "2\\sqrt[4]{e}" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382053 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536067 true] [17592186382053 1111 #uuid "acc7aff4-0fa8-5b3e-98af-f4d2a48966ff" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382054 1034 "2\\sqrt{e}" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382054 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536067 true] [17592186382054 1111 #uuid "21116642-ce8e-5b84-bea4-3d5b01f796f7" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382055 1034 "{e}^{-2}" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382055 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536067 true] [17592186382055 1111 #uuid "df7c962f-d303-508a-8cce-adc7fab78911" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382056 1034 "{e}^{2}" 13194139536067 true] [17592186382056 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536067 true] [17592186382056 1111 #uuid "98a57c4c-0a05-5b9c-bd55-7e476